{"cast":"unclejune","group":"game","bank":"game.2df5de5d37.bin","lines":[{"id":"game.intro.ones.01","moment":"game.intro.ones","text":"Ones at Blossom Park. First to eleven, make it take it. The bench is watching, so play clean.","off":0,"len":25556,"sec":5.306},{"id":"game.intro.ones.02","moment":"game.intro.ones","text":"One on one, the oldest game in the park. First to eleven. You score, you keep it.","off":25556,"len":21148,"sec":4.173},{"id":"game.intro.threes.01","moment":"game.intro.threes","text":"Threes, folks. Three a side, first to twenty-one, ninety seconds on the clock. Share the ball like it's ice cream.","off":46704,"len":28886,"sec":5.944},{"id":"game.intro.threes.02","moment":"game.intro.threes","text":"Now we've got a real run. Twenty-one wins, ninety-second clock. Back in my day, the clock was sundown.","off":75590,"len":26752,"sec":5.619},{"id":"game.check.01","moment":"game.check","text":"Their ball. Dig in, sprout.","off":102342,"len":11627,"sec":1.681},{"id":"game.check.02","moment":"game.check","text":"Check it up. Defense now.","off":113969,"len":11792,"sec":1.739},{"id":"game.check.03","moment":"game.check","text":"Other side's ball. Stay in front.","off":125761,"len":13064,"sec":1.978},{"id":"game.check.04","moment":"game.check","text":"Get low, youngster. Their ball.","off":138825,"len":12464,"sec":1.872},{"id":"game.make.01","moment":"game.make","text":"Sunday bucket.","off":151289,"len":8916,"sec":1.068},{"id":"game.make.02","moment":"game.make","text":"Pretty jumper.","off":160205,"len":8900,"sec":1.083},{"id":"game.make.03","moment":"game.make","text":"That'll play.","off":169105,"len":8371,"sec":0.91},{"id":"game.make.04","moment":"game.make","text":"Nice and easy.","off":177476,"len":9787,"sec":1.223},{"id":"game.make.05","moment":"game.make","text":"Good. Real good.","off":187263,"len":10320,"sec":1.333},{"id":"game.make.06","moment":"game.make","text":"Old-school. I like it.","off":197583,"len":10844,"sec":1.489},{"id":"game.three.01","moment":"game.three","text":"From way back. Lovely.","off":208427,"len":11186,"sec":1.545},{"id":"game.three.02","moment":"game.three","text":"Three! Rollie, ring it!","off":219613,"len":10883,"sec":1.449},{"id":"game.three.03","moment":"game.three","text":"Deep one. Park felt that.","off":230496,"len":11793,"sec":1.717},{"id":"game.three.04","moment":"game.three","text":"Ooh, from the petals!","off":242289,"len":10316,"sec":1.363},{"id":"game.three.05","moment":"game.three","text":"That's a grown-up shot.","off":252605,"len":10519,"sec":1.392},{"id":"game.layup.01","moment":"game.layup","text":"Soft. Like a petal.","off":263124,"len":10694,"sec":1.456},{"id":"game.layup.02","moment":"game.layup","text":"Laid it in nice.","off":273818,"len":9664,"sec":1.207},{"id":"game.layup.03","moment":"game.layup","text":"Old-timer finish. Beautiful.","off":283482,"len":13307,"sec":2.055},{"id":"game.layup.04","moment":"game.layup","text":"Up and in.","off":296789,"len":8653,"sec":0.981},{"id":"game.dunk.01","moment":"game.dunk","text":"Well, look at that!","off":305442,"len":9344,"sec":1.08},{"id":"game.dunk.02","moment":"game.dunk","text":"Right through it!","off":314786,"len":8621,"sec":0.951},{"id":"game.dunk.03","moment":"game.dunk","text":"Threw it down, sprout!","off":323407,"len":10205,"sec":1.328},{"id":"game.dunk.04","moment":"game.dunk","text":"Petals everywhere!","off":333612,"len":9439,"sec":1.218},{"id":"game.dunk.05","moment":"game.dunk","text":"Oh, the old tree shook!","off":343051,"len":11113,"sec":1.545},{"id":"game.poster.01","moment":"game.poster","text":"Oh, now hold on. Hold everything!","off":354164,"len":13236,"sec":1.997},{"id":"game.poster.02","moment":"game.poster","text":"Rollie dropped a cone on that!","off":367400,"len":11880,"sec":1.771},{"id":"game.poster.03","moment":"game.poster","text":"Frame that one for the fountain!","off":379280,"len":12854,"sec":1.919},{"id":"game.poster.04","moment":"game.poster","text":"Cornbread fell off the folding chair!","off":392134,"len":13592,"sec":2.133},{"id":"game.poster.05","moment":"game.poster","text":"Right on top of them!","off":405726,"len":10755,"sec":1.425},{"id":"game.poster.06","moment":"game.poster","text":"Forty years! Never! Never like that!","off":416481,"len":13212,"sec":2.008},{"id":"game.andone.01","moment":"game.andone","text":"Bumped and still scored!","off":429693,"len":10666,"sec":1.494},{"id":"game.andone.02","moment":"game.andone","text":"Bucket, and the whistle!","off":440359,"len":10443,"sec":1.349},{"id":"game.andone.03","moment":"game.andone","text":"And a cherry on top!","off":450802,"len":10651,"sec":1.52},{"id":"game.andone.04","moment":"game.andone","text":"Counts, plus the foul!","off":461453,"len":11094,"sec":1.553},{"id":"game.miss.01","moment":"game.miss","text":"Not quite.","off":472547,"len":8095,"sec":0.837},{"id":"game.miss.02","moment":"game.miss","text":"Rim wasn't having it.","off":480642,"len":10414,"sec":1.336},{"id":"game.miss.03","moment":"game.miss","text":"Next time, sprout.","off":491056,"len":10413,"sec":1.356},{"id":"game.miss.04","moment":"game.miss","text":"Close. Not close enough.","off":501469,"len":11255,"sec":1.555},{"id":"game.airball.01","moment":"game.airball","text":"Airball. The bench noticed.","off":512724,"len":11400,"sec":1.644},{"id":"game.airball.02","moment":"game.airball","text":"Missed everything. Even the petals.","off":524124,"len":12756,"sec":2.026},{"id":"game.airball.03","moment":"game.airball","text":"Oh, Cornbread's going to talk.","off":536880,"len":12965,"sec":1.918},{"id":"game.airball.04","moment":"game.airball","text":"My, my. Not even close.","off":549845,"len":11858,"sec":1.751},{"id":"game.block.01","moment":"game.block","text":"Sent it back!","off":561703,"len":8216,"sec":0.908},{"id":"game.block.02","moment":"game.block","text":"Rejected! Good hands, youngster!","off":569919,"len":13072,"sec":2.133},{"id":"game.block.03","moment":"game.block","text":"Blocked! Rollie felt that!","off":582991,"len":11088,"sec":1.546},{"id":"game.block.04","moment":"game.block","text":"Shooed it like a pigeon!","off":594079,"len":10493,"sec":1.43},{"id":"game.block.05","moment":"game.block","text":"Oh, that's a Sunday block.","off":604572,"len":11585,"sec":1.696},{"id":"game.block.06","moment":"game.block","text":"Nope! Not today!","off":616157,"len":10176,"sec":1.314},{"id":"game.blocked.01","moment":"game.blocked","text":"Blocked. Humbling, isn't it?","off":626333,"len":11545,"sec":1.623},{"id":"game.blocked.02","moment":"game.blocked","text":"Got stuffed. Happens.","off":637878,"len":10757,"sec":1.463},{"id":"game.blocked.03","moment":"game.blocked","text":"Oh, that one got caught.","off":648635,"len":11009,"sec":1.519},{"id":"game.blocked.04","moment":"game.blocked","text":"Try it again, sprout.","off":659644,"len":10780,"sec":1.521},{"id":"game.steal.01","moment":"game.steal","text":"Stole it! Clean!","off":670424,"len":9572,"sec":1.27},{"id":"game.steal.02","moment":"game.steal","text":"Took it right from them!","off":679996,"len":10491,"sec":1.429},{"id":"game.steal.03","moment":"game.steal","text":"Ha! Didn't even see it!","off":690487,"len":10302,"sec":1.374},{"id":"game.steal.04","moment":"game.steal","text":"Your ball now, sprout.","off":700789,"len":10673,"sec":1.461},{"id":"game.steal.05","moment":"game.steal","text":"Quick hands, youngster!","off":711462,"len":10662,"sec":1.457},{"id":"game.stolen.01","moment":"game.stolen","text":"Lost it. Hold on tighter.","off":722124,"len":12057,"sec":1.806},{"id":"game.stolen.02","moment":"game.stolen","text":"Go on, fetch it.","off":734181,"len":10314,"sec":1.374},{"id":"game.stolen.03","moment":"game.stolen","text":"Oh, they took your lunch.","off":744495,"len":11142,"sec":1.534},{"id":"game.stolen.04","moment":"game.stolen","text":"Loose handle. Tighten it up.","off":755637,"len":12039,"sec":1.757},{"id":"game.ankles.01","moment":"game.ankles","text":"Bring the defender a chair!","off":767676,"len":12008,"sec":1.755},{"id":"game.ankles.02","moment":"game.ankles","text":"Crossed up! Petals flying!","off":779684,"len":12123,"sec":1.812},{"id":"game.ankles.03","moment":"game.ankles","text":"Whoa, where'd the defender go?","off":791807,"len":12088,"sec":1.769},{"id":"game.ankles.04","moment":"game.ankles","text":"Oh, that's just unkind!","off":803895,"len":11739,"sec":1.699},{"id":"game.ankles.05","moment":"game.ankles","text":"The old-timers felt that!","off":815634,"len":11818,"sec":1.678},{"id":"game.ankles.06","moment":"game.ankles","text":"Ha! Defender's at the fountain!","off":827452,"len":12410,"sec":1.906},{"id":"game.bite.01","moment":"game.bite","text":"Fell for it!","off":839862,"len":7809,"sec":0.816},{"id":"game.bite.02","moment":"game.bite","text":"Oldest trick in the park.","off":847671,"len":11251,"sec":1.592},{"id":"game.bite.03","moment":"game.bite","text":"Fooled them. Patience pays.","off":858922,"len":12113,"sec":1.711},{"id":"game.bite.04","moment":"game.bite","text":"Defender jumped at shadows!","off":871035,"len":12905,"sec":1.892},{"id":"game.foul.01","moment":"game.foul","text":"Whistle. Hold up.","off":883940,"len":10109,"sec":1.298},{"id":"game.foul.02","moment":"game.foul","text":"That's a call.","off":894049,"len":8962,"sec":0.997},{"id":"game.foul.03","moment":"game.foul","text":"Easy now, play clean.","off":903011,"len":11345,"sec":1.657},{"id":"game.foul.04","moment":"game.foul","text":"Rule book says no.","off":914356,"len":10831,"sec":1.468},{"id":"game.rival.make.01","moment":"game.rival.make","text":"They answered. Answer back.","off":925187,"len":11680,"sec":1.629},{"id":"game.rival.make.02","moment":"game.rival.make","text":"Other side scores. Your turn.","off":936867,"len":12730,"sec":1.962},{"id":"game.rival.make.03","moment":"game.rival.make","text":"Well, they can play too.","off":949597,"len":11154,"sec":1.572},{"id":"game.rival.make.04","moment":"game.rival.make","text":"Bucket for them. Stay patient.","off":960751,"len":12549,"sec":1.846},{"id":"game.rival.make.05","moment":"game.rival.make","text":"Don't let that settle, sprout.","off":973300,"len":11932,"sec":1.747},{"id":"game.rival.dunk.01","moment":"game.rival.dunk","text":"Oh, they meant that one.","off":985232,"len":11024,"sec":1.499},{"id":"game.rival.dunk.02","moment":"game.rival.dunk","text":"That one's going in their scrapbook.","off":996256,"len":12709,"sec":1.844},{"id":"game.rival.dunk.03","moment":"game.rival.dunk","text":"Easy, sprout. Get it back.","off":1008965,"len":11577,"sec":1.677},{"id":"game.rival.dunk.04","moment":"game.rival.dunk","text":"Loud one. Don't take it personal.","off":1020542,"len":12629,"sec":1.92},{"id":"game.run.01","moment":"game.run","text":"Unanswered, and the bench is counting.","off":1033171,"len":13645,"sec":2.125},{"id":"game.run.02","moment":"game.run","text":"Rolling now. Somebody stop this youngster.","off":1046816,"len":15000,"sec":2.455},{"id":"game.run.03","moment":"game.run","text":"Look at this run. Petals can't keep up.","off":1061816,"len":13882,"sec":2.263},{"id":"game.run.04","moment":"game.run","text":"That's a spring rain, folks. Steady, steady.","off":1075698,"len":15581,"sec":2.545},{"id":"game.point.us.01","moment":"game.point","text":"One more bucket, sprout. Then ice cream.","tags":["side:us"],"off":1091279,"len":14428,"sec":2.439},{"id":"game.point.them.01","moment":"game.point","text":"Their game point. One stop. Just one.","tags":["side:them"],"off":1105707,"len":14315,"sec":2.262},{"id":"game.win.01","moment":"game.win","text":"Game! Checkers table, you seeing this?","off":1120022,"len":13744,"sec":2.138},{"id":"game.win.02","moment":"game.win","text":"That's the game, sprout. The bench tips its caps.","off":1133766,"len":16295,"sec":2.731},{"id":"game.win.03","moment":"game.win","text":"Winner! Rollie, one cone, on the house!","off":1150061,"len":13682,"sec":2.285},{"id":"game.win.04","moment":"game.win","text":"Ballgame! Just like the old Sundays!","off":1163743,"len":14171,"sec":2.19},{"id":"game.loss.01","moment":"game.loss","text":"They take it. Run it back. I'm not going anywhere.","off":1177914,"len":15817,"sec":2.735},{"id":"game.loss.02","moment":"game.loss","text":"Other side wins it. Spring's long. Plenty more runs.","off":1193731,"len":17419,"sec":3.047},{"id":"game.loss.03","moment":"game.loss","text":"Game's theirs. The bench saw the effort, youngster. Come back.","off":1211150,"len":17369,"sec":3.05},{"id":"game.draw.01","moment":"game.draw","text":"Tied at the horn. Even the petals can't pick.","off":1228519,"len":15526,"sec":2.56},{"id":"game.draw.02","moment":"game.draw","text":"A tie. We'd have played till the lamps came on.","off":1244045,"len":15070,"sec":2.422},{"id":"game.assist.01","moment":"game.assist","text":"Beautiful pass!","off":1259115,"len":9309,"sec":1.163},{"id":"game.assist.02","moment":"game.assist","text":"Shared it. That's manners.","off":1268424,"len":11016,"sec":1.501},{"id":"game.assist.03","moment":"game.assist","text":"What a dime!","off":1279440,"len":8824,"sec":0.951},{"id":"game.assist.04","moment":"game.assist","text":"Found the open hooper.","off":1288264,"len":10696,"sec":1.421},{"id":"game.alleyoop.01","moment":"game.alleyoop","text":"Alley-oop! Oh, lovely!","off":1298960,"len":11102,"sec":1.516},{"id":"game.alleyoop.02","moment":"game.alleyoop","text":"Up top! Caught and flushed!","off":1310062,"len":11327,"sec":1.622},{"id":"game.alleyoop.03","moment":"game.alleyoop","text":"Lobbed it, they finished it!","off":1321389,"len":11171,"sec":1.554},{"id":"game.clock.01","moment":"game.clock","text":"Ten seconds, folks!","off":1332560,"len":10953,"sec":1.484},{"id":"game.clock.02","moment":"game.clock","text":"Clock's going. Ten left!","off":1343513,"len":11758,"sec":1.624},{"id":"game.clock.03","moment":"game.clock","text":"Hurry, sprout! Ten seconds!","off":1355271,"len":12322,"sec":1.841},{"id":"game.overdrive.01","moment":"game.overdrive","text":"Whole team's in bloom now!","off":1367593,"len":11613,"sec":1.818},{"id":"game.overdrive.02","moment":"game.overdrive","text":"Now that's a team!","off":1379206,"len":10597,"sec":1.385},{"id":"game.overdrive.03","moment":"game.overdrive","text":"All together now! Beautiful!","off":1389803,"len":12374,"sec":1.842}]}